# SKID KIDS: MOOSE (July's kit) runs rivals over: walking into one at the
# line knocks it down (no point), unless it jumps; holding the pad toward a
# rival counts even when the line stops him. Special throw YO-YO, move
# REEL. (2P versus, so player 2 can jump.)
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat versus 11 1 0 3
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
cheat kid 0 156 80
cheat kid 2 164 100
hold DOWN 20
expect n_push == 1
expect kst2 == 5
expect score0 == 0
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
# a rival in the air can't be run over
cheat kid 0 156 80
cheat kid 2 164 100
press P2A
hold DOWN 12
expect n_push == 1
expect kst2 != 5
# pressed against the line, holding toward a rival just over it: that's
# walking into it (the centre-line trick), though MOOSE can't step closer
wait 30
cheat kid 0 156 100
cheat kid 2 164 100
hold RIGHT 10
expect n_push == 2
expect kst2 == 5
expect kx0 == 156
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
# the yo-yo
wait 30
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat kid 2 200 100
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 70
wait 2
expect bagkind0 == 2
waituntil score0 == 2 150
# the reel
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 0 100 60
cheat loose 40 160
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 5
press A
waituntil held0 == 1 60
